abstract: "Desktop application (Windows / Linux / macOS) for quantum error correction research and evaluation. Provides 13 decoder algorithms, 9 code families, a full GUI, command-line interface, and a 47-tool Model Context Protocol (MCP) server. Built on the qector-decoder-v3 Rust/Python backend."
